;; Vouchers: Sales, Purchases, SalesOrders, PurchaseOrders, Receipts, Payments, CreditNotes, DebitNotes, Journals, Contras, StockJournals, DeliveryNotes, ReceiptNotes
;; Masters: Ledgers, StockItems, Groups, Units, Godowns, StockGroups, CostCentres | Stock summary: Yes
;; Format: XML | Depth: full | Incremental: alterid | Chunk: month | Auth: header
;; Auto on voucher save: Sales, Purchases | Auto on master save: Yes | Timer: 15 min
;; Gate: gstin | Sync-status UDF: Yes | Log: Yes | Pull (experimental): Yes
;; URL template: https://api.example.com/tally/{company}
;; Backend must reply <ENVELOPE><STATUS>1</STATUS></ENVELOPE> for HTTP Post to count as success.
;; Load via F1 > TDL & Add-On > Manage Local TDLs. UNTESTED on real TallyPrime - lines marked [EXPERIMENTAL] are least certain.

[#Menu: Gateway of Tally]
    Add: Key Item: At End: Sync: Y: Menu: TS Sync Menu

[Menu: TS Sync Menu]
    Title: "Sync"
    Key Item: Configuration: C: Display: TS Config
    Key Item: Set Date Range: D: Display: TS Dates
    Key Item: Push Sales Vouchers: 1: Call: TS Push Sales
    Key Item: Push Purchase Vouchers: 2: Call: TS Push Purchases
    Key Item: Push Sales Order Vouchers: 3: Call: TS Push SalesOrders
    Key Item: Push Purchase Order Vouchers: 4: Call: TS Push PurchaseOrders
    Key Item: Push Receipt Vouchers: 5: Call: TS Push Receipts
    Key Item: Push Payment Vouchers: 6: Call: TS Push Payments
    Key Item: Push Credit Note Vouchers: 7: Call: TS Push CreditNotes
    Key Item: Push Debit Note Vouchers: 8: Call: TS Push DebitNotes
    Key Item: Push Journal Vouchers: 9: Call: TS Push Journals
    Key Item: Push Contra Vouchers: A: Call: TS Push Contras
    Key Item: Push Stock Journal Vouchers: B: Call: TS Push StockJournals
    Key Item: Push Delivery Note Vouchers: E: Call: TS Push DeliveryNotes
    Key Item: Push Receipt Note Vouchers: F: Call: TS Push ReceiptNotes
    Key Item: Push Ledgers: G: Call: TS Push Ledgers
    Key Item: Push Stock Items: H: Call: TS Push StockItems
    Key Item: Push Groups: I: Call: TS Push Groups
    Key Item: Push Units: J: Call: TS Push Units
    Key Item: Push Godowns: K: Call: TS Push Godowns
    Key Item: Push Stock Groups: M: Call: TS Push StockGroups
    Key Item: Push Cost Centres: N: Call: TS Push CostCentres
    Key Item: Push Stock Summary: S: Call: TS Push StockSummary
    Key Item: Push All: L: Call: TS Push All
    Key Item: Sync Log: Y: Display: TS Log
    Key Item: Pull from URL (Experimental): P: Menu: TS Pull Menu
    Item: Blank
    Key Item: @@locQuit: Q: Menu Quit

