[#Menu: TS Sync Menu]
    Add: Key Item: Retry / Re-run All: R: Call: TS Push All

;; [EXPERIMENTAL] Pull: backend returns <ENVELOPE><LEDGER><NAME/><PARENT/></LEDGER>...<STOCKITEM><NAME/><PARENT/><BASEUNITS/></STOCKITEM></ENVELOPE>
[Menu: TS Pull Menu]
    Title: "Pull from URL (Experimental)"
    Key Item: Preview remote ledgers: V: Display: TS Pull Preview
    Key Item: Create ledgers: L: Call: TS Pull Ledgers
    Key Item: Create stock items: I: Call: TS Pull Items

[Collection: TS Pull Col Ledgers]
    Remote URL: @@TSBaseURL + "/pull/ledgers" + @@TSAuthQS
    XMLObjectPath: LEDGER: 1: ENVELOPE
    Fetch: NAME, PARENT
    Export Header: "x-api-key: " + ##TSApiKey

[Function: TS Pull Ledgers]
    00: If: NOT @@TSGateOK
    01: Msg Box: "Pull blocked": "Open company does not match the configured company"
    02: Return
    03: End If
    04: Walk Collection: TS Pull Col Ledgers
    05: New Object: Ledger
    06: Set Value: Name: $NAME
    07: Set Value: Parent: $PARENT
    09: Create Target
    10: End Walk
    11: Msg Box: "Pull": "Done"

[Collection: TS Pull Col Items]
    Remote URL: @@TSBaseURL + "/pull/items" + @@TSAuthQS
    XMLObjectPath: STOCKITEM: 1: ENVELOPE
    Fetch: NAME, PARENT, BASEUNITS
    Export Header: "x-api-key: " + ##TSApiKey

[Function: TS Pull Items]
    00: If: NOT @@TSGateOK
    01: Msg Box: "Pull blocked": "Open company does not match the configured company"
    02: Return
    03: End If
    04: Walk Collection: TS Pull Col Items
    05: New Object: Stock Item
    06: Set Value: Name: $NAME
    07: Set Value: Parent: $PARENT
    08: Set Value: BaseUnits: $BASEUNITS
    09: Create Target
    10: End Walk
    11: Msg Box: "Pull": "Done"

[Report: TS Pull Preview]
    Form: TS Pull Preview
    Title: "Remote Ledgers (Experimental)"

[Form: TS Pull Preview]
    Part: TS Pull Preview

[Part: TS Pull Preview]
    Line: TS Pull Line
    Repeat: TS Pull Line: TS Pull Col Ledgers
    Scroll: Vertical

[Line: TS Pull Line]
    Fields: TS Pull Name, TS Pull Parent

[Field: TS Pull Name]
    Use: Name Field
    Set As: $NAME

[Field: TS Pull Parent]
    Use: Name Field
    Set As: $PARENT

